          <td style="padding:8px;">20,000–50,000</td>
          <td style="padding:8px;">20,000–50,000</td>
        </tr>
        <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid #eee0d8;">
          <td style="padding:8px;"><strong>Pulpa</strong></td>
          <td style="padding:8px;">Racimo de pared fina</td>
